  "instructions": {
    "set": "Deep-copy named example, set each JSON pointer in insertion order, then recompute only that document own digest when true. Mutating a nested record does not repair its digest automatically. Schema runs before supplemental checks. Cases with schema=false do not assert supplemental acceptance.",
    "message_page_recipe": "Deep-copy message_page_partial. Replace items with item_count copies of message_present; for zero-based i, id = 00000000-0000-4000-8000- plus lowercase hex(i+1) left-padded to 12 digits; conversation_sequence = i+1; body = body_text repeated body_repeat. Recompute each record own digest, then page own digest. Preserve all other fields. Serialize canonical UTF-8; append target_raw_bytes minus canonical byte length ASCII spaces when requested.",
    "output_boundary": "Read output raw byte maximum is 262144; reject at byte length 262145 before parse. This is a boundary recipe/assertion, not an implemented decoder. COMMAND decoder remains 32768.",
    "supplemental_order": "exact company/scope for every contained record/reference, page conversation and visibility coherence, duplicate record IDs/sequences, decoded UTF-8 byte maxima and NUL, then recursive own-digest verification; raw strict decoding always precedes schema.",
    "digest_preimage": "For each present record or available page, omit only its own top-level digest property. Retain every other field including nested reference/record digest values and nulls. SHA-256 over frozen canonical UTF-8. No hash of supplied digest over itself."
  },
